{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00094",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 2.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Right, come in and get settled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.54,
      "end_seconds": 6.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Thanks, doctor. It's been a long few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.64,
      "end_seconds": 9.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.09,
      "end_seconds": 14.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.18,
      "end_seconds": 17.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.53,
      "end_seconds": 33.06,
      "duration_seconds": 15.53,
      "text": "Mainly a red swollen area on my leg. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. I just want to get back to normal, really. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.81,
      "end_seconds": 35.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.43,
      "end_seconds": 48.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "About... well, about two weeks. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.62,
      "end_seconds": 53.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.96,
      "end_seconds": 58.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I notice it more with walking. It's all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.01,
      "end_seconds": 63.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.72,
      "end_seconds": 67.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Well, it's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.05,
      "end_seconds": 70.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Any numbness around it or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.17,
      "end_seconds": 75.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I haven't had numbness around it or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.26,
      "end_seconds": 85.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.78,
      "end_seconds": 89.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.26,
      "end_seconds": 94.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.95,
      "end_seconds": 95.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.46,
      "end_seconds": 116.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.21,
      "end_seconds": 118.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.79,
      "end_seconds": 124.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.46,
      "end_seconds": 129.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.96,
      "end_seconds": 130.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.2,
      "end_seconds": 134.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Right, no, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.9,
      "end_seconds": 139.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.08,
      "end_seconds": 140.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.21,
      "end_seconds": 156.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What medicines do you take regularly? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.39,
      "end_seconds": 161.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "It's glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.11,
      "end_seconds": 164.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.94,
      "end_seconds": 167.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.45,
      "end_seconds": 180.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.98,
      "end_seconds": 183.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Yes, I'm allergic to penicillin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.74,
      "end_seconds": 187.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.31,
      "end_seconds": 191.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.8,
      "end_seconds": 195.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.96,
      "end_seconds": 197.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.52,
      "end_seconds": 201.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.01,
      "end_seconds": 221.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "There's a small scab where the cut was, no pus coming out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.29,
      "end_seconds": 222.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.22,
      "end_seconds": 242.41,
      "duration_seconds": 14.19,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.39,
      "end_seconds": 255.64,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.84,
      "end_seconds": 260.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Putting it all together, my working impression is cellulitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.91,
      "end_seconds": 263.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.65,
      "end_seconds": 282.18,
      "duration_seconds": 17.53,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now cellulitis is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a red swollen area on your leg for about two weeks, and no numbness around it or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.01,
      "end_seconds": 284.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.68,
      "end_seconds": 289.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "We should do a wound swab for infected wound."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.7,
      "end_seconds": 291.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.36,
      "end_seconds": 315.49,
      "duration_seconds": 22.13,
      "text": "Let's use clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day, for seven days. It's for skin infection. Keep the leg raised on a pillow when you're sitting. Mark the edge of the redness with a pen so we can see whether it spreads. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.6,
      "end_seconds": 323.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the redness spreads or the fever gets higher. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.11,
      "end_seconds": 326.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.95,
      "end_seconds": 332.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Come back in two days. Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.14,
      "end_seconds": 343.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "So, I take the clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.3,
      "end_seconds": 347.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.3,
      "end_seconds": 351.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Well, no, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}